{"candidateAnswer":"Water sports and outdoor activities","evidence":"[D1:7 | 7:48 pm on 21 May, 2023] John: I'm a shooting guard for the team and our season opener is next week - so excited!\n[D2:14 | 5:08 pm on 15 June, 2023] John: That sounds awesome! So cool that you get to immerse yourself in that world. So glad you found something that brings you so much joy. Keep diving in and enjoying it! Here's a pic from a recent game.\n[D3:1 | 4:21 pm on 16 July, 2023] John: Hey Tim! Good to see you again. So much has happened in the last month - on and off the court. Last week I scored 40 points, my highest ever, and it feels like all my hard work's paying off.\n[D3:25 | 4:21 pm on 16 July, 2023] John: I had an awesome summer with my friends, surfing and riding the waves. The feeling was unreal!","itemId":"urn:uuid:7ba83f1b-ca17-5954-bc40-e73d1e98ac1c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f776d564ebba71de3a07adddefd6187ee9bf48cb3e3cf47aa4a7cf6b39c66430","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What sports does John like besides basketball?","referenceAnswer":"surfing","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f776d564ebba71de3a07adddefd6187ee9bf48cb3e3cf47aa4a7cf6b39c66430"}}]}